    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Madcap Meks",
    "summary": "During your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), roll 1 D6 whenever all ranged attacks by one of your **BIG MEK**, **MEK GUNZ**, **MORKANAUT** or **WAZBOM BLASTAJET** units target the same enemy unit:\n\n- **Dat's Weird** (1): the target gains a 4+ **[InSv](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls)**.\n- **Hop Splat** (2–3): pick another enemy unit up to 3\" from the target; it suffers D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n- **Seekerz** (4): those attacks get +1 to **[hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)**.\n- **Lifted** (5): the target gains **FLY** and loses the **[benefit of cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**.\n- **Runtified** (6): the target has −1 **T**.\n\nResults 1, 5 and 6 last until your unit finishes shooting.",
